			"notes": "## Baritone for Minecraft 26.1 (Fabric)\n\nPorted from MC 1.21.11 to MC 26.1 (unobfuscated).\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for MC 26.1\n2. Place the jar into your `mods` folder\n3. Use `#help` in game chat for commands\n\n### Changes\n- Migrated build system to Fabric Loom 1.15 + Gradle 9.4.0\n- Updated all MC API calls for unobfuscated MC 26.1\n- Fixed rendering pipeline, ChunkPos record, ItemStack, LevelRenderer etc."
